# Grocery List - Firebase Cloud Sync Configuration
# To enable real-time cloud synchronization between multiple devices:
# 1. Create a project at https://console.firebase.google.com/
# 2. Add a Web App in Project Settings -> General -> Your apps
# 3. Enable Authentication (Email/Password or Anonymous) under Build -> Authentication
# 4. Enable Cloud Firestore under Build -> Firestore Database
# 5. Copy the configuration values below into your .env or .env.local file:

EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project_id.firebaseapp.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project_id.appspot.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_messaging_sender_id
EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_app_id
